00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:10,000
It's nothing personal. It's just their job.

2
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Monsters, Inc. is a animation, comedy, family film directed by Pete Docter.

3
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team
at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis.

4
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:22,000
When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it's the monsters who are scared silly,
and it's up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.

5
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Sullivan (voice), played by John Goodman.

6
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Mike (voice), played by Billy Crystal.

7
